\label{definition-quotient}
Notation $U \to S$, $G$, $R$ as in Lemma \ref{lemma-quotient}.
If the action of $G$ on $U$ satisfies $(*)$ we say $G$ {\it acts freely}
on the scheme $U$. In this case the algebraic space $U/R$ is denoted
